Description: regex helper: port to pcre2
 The pcre3 development files are no longer shipped by the distrelease this
 package builds against, so the regex helper moves to the pcre2 API with an
 8-bit code unit width, and the build links pcre2-8 instead of pcre.
Author: VitruvianOS Ports <ports@vitruvian.invalid>
Forwarded: no
Origin: upstream https://github.com/HaikuArchives/Paladin @ 5b7c442bd68eb3e04ce2b5b780eb2314db3b977a

